BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 388.77 Tm (Title: Four Checks Before Filing, Billing, Or Collecting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 373.55 Tm (Body: Each check below comes from a pitfall a practitioner hit or warned about directly. Clear all four before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.32 Tm (an out-of-network claim moves to negotiation, dispute, or collections.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.10 Tm (Items: Confirm plan type before routing the claim. There is no reliable way to tell self-funded from insured) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 327.87 Tm (plans, and a card may show only a small 'sf' [Miller Johnson - EwlPyAVGU8k @ 00:08:21].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 312.65 Tm (Read the remittance for the QPA before choosing a forum. A plan sends the QPA with its remittance advice) Tj ET
