BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 251.75 Tm (Push back on ERISA overpayment refund and recoupment letters. Orion Billing calls them illegal and says) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 236.52 Tm (insurers get away with them because nobody challenges them [Orion Billing - Medical Billing Basics -) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.30 Tm (_z9Vfv0D6_4 @ 00:02:13].) Tj ET
BT /F0 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 199.07 Tm (Pull Quote) Tj ET
