BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (claim fields and set accept assignment to No, so the insurer pays the client. For superbills, pick a date range) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (and hit create superbill. The statement auto-fills provider NPI, license and tax ID, dates of service, a GT) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (modifier on telehealth lines, diagnosis and charges, totaling $540 in the demo [FpNL1YIlvD0 @ 00:01:57].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (Alicia Murray's Jane setup auto-populates a superbill after every appointment, and it takes one or two clicks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (to email it [eXrZnEwRRH4 @ 00:06:50]. Dr. Lauren Baker walks the patient side of a Humana claims form.) Tj ET
