BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (Package superbills are where Jarod Carter gets surgical. A purchase receipt cannot serve as a superbill,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (because nothing can be submitted for visits that have not happened yet. Every date of service gets its own) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (entry. Carter's example is a $200 hour sold at $10 off per session in a 10-pack. The units still add up to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (full rate, and a line-item package discount drops each visit to $190. Alternatively, one bottom-line discount,) Tj ET
