BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (Victoria runs verification the night before or days ahead to catch terminated coverage and wrong payer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (order. She notes that Medicaid is usually the last payer and does not like to pay anything before everyone) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (else does [pG2R1NwUlro @ 00:05:00]. As a supervisor, Victoria also trained front-desk staff on incident-to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (and advanced-practitioner billing. Billing under the provider can earn 100% of the fee schedule, while many) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (payers reduce pay on visits handled only by an APP. The AMA team adds a hard fix drawn from Chen's own) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (loss. After a centralized business office relied on a 'payer matrix' instead of obtaining real prior auth, denied) Tj ET
