BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (submission. The common gaps it lists are unchecked boxes, missing prior-auth numbers, and missing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (taxonomy or NPI. It also requires every CPT code to link to a diagnosis code, with no code changes made) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (without clinician approval [Ie5ARcGEY1g @ 00:19:04]. Amazing Charts' Greg layers a second) Tj ET
