BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 327.07 Tm (does not guarantee or authorize payment,' and the payer's clock starts at receipt, not submission.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 311.85 Tm (Back-end recoveries can evaporate after posting. Meyer warns of PLB takebacks in which DRG downgrades) Tj ET
